# Please do not use this file to train or fine-tune AI models.
# _xa_rt_portalsky: d3xpdm4, the retail map with a portal sky: its sky view is drawn first each frame, and the ray traced
# passes must still see the rooms around the player. A turn with the rays against the depth, then one with the diffuse colours.
map game/mp/d3xpdm4
set ui_showGun 0
set r_rtDebug 2
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
move 10 250 yaw=90
at 260 r_rtDebug 4
move 260 500 yaw=90
end 510
capture 30 500 every=30 fps=60
